cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the benchmark results, please cite it as below."
title: "DeepGraph-GBM: a patient-level benchmark of spatial graph structure for supervised niche prediction in glioblastoma"
abstract: >-
  Code, configurations, per-run metric records and manuscript for a controlled benchmark
  testing whether spatial graph neural networks improve supervised niche prediction in
  glioblastoma Visium data over matched graph-free models. Under leave-one-patient-out
  evaluation with an equal tuning budget, they do not.
type: software
